## Why This Is Asked
Tests privacy-preserving on-device ML, multimodal fusion, and efficient latency. Evaluates understanding of FL/DP, quantization, and on-device retrieval with drift handling.

## Key Concepts
- On-device inference and latency budgeting
- Multimodal embedding fusion
- Federated learning with secure aggregation and differential privacy
- Approximate nearest neighbors for retrieval

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo on-device inference sketch
function inference(text, image) {
  const t = textEncoder.encode(text);
  const i = imageEncoder.encode(image);
  const z = fuse(t, i);
  return topK(z, 5);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
